<title>HONG KONG: Star Telecom, Tricom shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Star Telecom, Tricom shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Star Telecommunication International Holding Ltd and Tricom Holdings Ltd was suspended in the afternoon at the companies' request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of telecommunications operator Star Telecom were up HK$0.20 or 10 percent to HK$2.20 at midday on volume of 4.62 million shares worth HK$9.68 million.</p>
<p>Tricom shares were unchanged at HK$1.95.</p>
<p>Tricom supplies telephone systems, office automation and personal communications products.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
